  "description": "What would you do if your life was taken over by an R-rated dating simulation game? That’s a question Gowoon never imagined he’d have to answer, but it’s happening to him whether he likes it or not. Somehow, a virtual reality dating sim has invaded his real life, and now he has three men vying for his attention—and his body. Gowoon would prefer none of them, thank you very much, but the game won’t stop…unless, perhaps, he were to clear it. Maybe the only way out is through. And there’s only one way to find out… \n\n(Source: Lezhin) \n\n*Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
